- Phase-2b integration Run wf_866cfc96-f23:
  - merges catalog-fixes e2474b5 (D16 + stale-origin-block gating), native-acceptance d3512be (restartable rollback) and scheduler-stopfix 753bd85;
  - coordinator decisions: Checkpoint.Complete() does NOT require zero Orca omitted bindings (non-Claude v1 bindings are informational not_restorable and never block Claude recovery completeness); the relaxed stale-relay reading is accepted (a checkpoint the origin already dropped does not gate ACK, and no durability claim results); pickup selectors, restorability and the resident ready count switch to PickupReady (default pickup never picks an incomplete or unverified newer checkpoint; --allow-partial is explicit);
  - CI config aligned (GOOS=darwin lint/vuln, macOS tests) and fragments re-rendered;
  - watches PR #1 to green.
- reposync final merge coherent at 826a351. The reposync DRAFT PR is being opened now (Run wf_cda80492-fda); its whole-diff review/fix/docs stages push onto it.
